+        # recipe (port of vLLM #63219): the worker keeps each request's
+        # drafts until the scheduler fetches them (DraftTokensHandler), so a
+        # deferred step's window holds the real, grammar-validated drafts and
+        # counts in full. The g4 invalidation (vLLM PR 54442) stays as the net
+        # for a window that still holds placeholders the worker never
